<title>USA: Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle market quiet - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle market quiet - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was inactive in the</p>
<p>Panhandle area Monday, USDA said. Slaughter steers and heifers</p>
<p>were not tested. Feedlots reporting light to moderate inquiry</p>
<p>from buyers. Confirmed sales this week 5,400 head.</p>
<p>Confirmed -  None    Week Ago - None   Year Ago - None</p>
<p>Wk to date - 5,400   Week Ago - None   Year Ago - 62,900</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
